**DIRAC
.WAVE FUNCTIONS
.PROPERTIES
**HAMILTONIAN
.LEVY-LEBLOND   ! non-relativistic
!                 or
!.LVCORR          Dirac-Coulomb Hamiltonian without (SS|SS) integrals using LV correction
.DFT
LDA             ! the functional is LDA
**INTEGRALS
.NUCMOD
2               ! Gaussian model
!                 or
!1                point charge
*TWOINT
.SCREEN
1.0D-16         ! screening of two-electron integrals
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.DHF
*DHFCAL
.EVCCNV
1.0E-8 1.0E-6   ! converge to 1.0E-8 in the error vector but accept error vector below 1.0E-6
.ITRINT
0 0             ! include (LL|LL) and (LL|SS) integrals from the 0th iteration on
!                 (so right from the start)
!                 a good choice if you restart from a previous run
**PROPERTIES
.POLARIZABILITY ! calculate the electric dipole polarizability
*LINEAR RESPONSE
.B FREQ
1               ! ... for only one frequency
0.072           ! ... for the frequency 0.072 a.u.
*END OF
